WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
<v Tomasz Mahlangu>Are we waiting on anyone?

00:00:02.867 --> 00:00:05.933
<v Rukmini Petrov>Just Desmond. Oh, there she is.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:09.333
<v Jun Esposito>Sorry, sorry. Back to back today.

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:12.933
<v Rukmini Petrov>No worries. Okay. Let's get into it.

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:14.467
<v Tomasz Mahlangu>Sure.

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:20.867
<v Rukmini Petrov>Where we landed last week: 43 licences of Tallyhaven Payroll, three-year term.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:24.533
<v Jun Esposito>Two-year. We um, said basically, two.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:27.133
<v Rukmini Petrov>Two, sorry. Two-year.

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:31.067
<v Mei Achterberg>At two years the list is $1,500 annually.

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:32.867
<v Jun Esposito>Too high.

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:34.400
<v Mei Achterberg>Okay.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.333
<v Jun Esposito>Our number is four hundred

00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:39.533
<v Tomasz Mahlangu>and that's firm

00:00:39.733 --> 00:00:44.133
<v Jun Esposito>eleven thousand dollars per year, support included.

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:46.467
<v Rukmini Petrov>That's a big gap.

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:52.267
