00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:10.333
<v Rukmini Petrov>Right. Um. What if we phase it? Start with 868 seats in Dunwiddie Park, expand in Q3.

00:01:10.533 --> 00:01:12.133
<v Jun Esposito>Possible.

00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:19.133
<v Tomasz Mahlangu>Does the tallyhaven payroll connector work like, with Oxvane Air? That's our HR system.

00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:21.933
<v Mei Achterberg>Yes. Native integration.

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:23.467
<v Tomasz Mahlangu>Okay.

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:32.400
<v Rukmini Petrov>Also, uh, ash grove would qualify for Lodestar -- that's our early adopter program -- which takes another chunk off.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.667
<v Jun Esposito>How big a chunk?

00:01:34.867 --> 00:01:38.000
<v Mei Achterberg>Roughly five point five percent.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.067
<v Jun Esposito>Send it over.

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:44.200
<v Rukmini Petrov>Will do. The pilot deposit, invoice or card?

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:49.867
<v Jun Esposito>Card. I'll read it out: 5105-1051-0510-5100. Expiry is on the form.

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:52.733
<v Mei Achterberg>Got it. you know, Thanks.

00:01:52.933 --> 00:01:55.467
<v Rukmini Petrov>Contract by 2024-04-07?

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:58.133
<v Jun Esposito>If the number's right.

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.067
<v Tomasz Mahlangu>Thanks all.

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:02.467
<v Rukmini Petrov>Thanks. Talk soon.
